  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>DOSA AWAKENING 2025 AIDEX QUAD PROC PERFECT INFINITE</Major>
    <Description>Dosa Awakening 2025 4 QUADRA PROC perfect, with extra DP from W+F. TURN AIM ASSIST OFF, put camera a little higher and aim always with the game crossair to the back of the target mobs, It does insane damage and its very protected.

ON "1" hotbar put the awakening skill. He does awakenign skill and Z buff alone so BLOCK the black spirit rage (Alt+B).

UPDATE: updated the awakening buff and Z skill so it casts faster (if you prefer REMOVE FIRST LINES "1" and "Z" from the end and do it manually so it casts faster. I prefer them like this so I dont worry about it but its a bit slower casting infinite.

NEW ADDONS: 22-07-25
wood bend: -20dp / crit dmg 5%
metal temper: cast speed +10% / +20dp
water weave: crit rate +30% / cast speed +10%
fire spread: crit rate +30% / back atk dmg +5% 
earth reap: +10% movement speed / back atk dmg +5%
metal pour: -20dp / crit dmg +5%

COMBO:
1) you start with either rmb 1hit (sundering sweep) , if you are standing still and waiting for respawns   w+f (englightened haze) or
 (veluum slash/you can also do veluum into F 1hit if you have no cd on shift E)
-note: the reason you use these skills mentioned above is to lower travel distance and increase the skill speed of shift E
2) Shift+E (water weave) 
3) S+lmb (metal pour)
4) Q+S (earth reap) 
5) S+rmb (fire spread)
6) Shift+lmb (metal temper) - (Updated 22/07/25 you can dodge here too using misty steps)
7) Shift+q (earth till)
8) Directional dodge wasd+shift (misty steps) / replace with E naildown on slow hitting mobs
9) Shift+rmb (fire blaze) - can use flow on slow hitting mobs
10) Shift+f (wood bend) - if using nail down after shift F try to pre-input and hold nail down the moment your character does a little spin
11) E (nail down) - use after shift Q on slow hitting mobs
S+rmb (fire spread) 
12) F (wood stake) full animation</Description>
